<h1>Hall of Fame Game 2026: <em>The Rookie Athletes to Watch</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 7 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>🏟️ Preseason 2026</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">The 2026 NFL season kicks off Thursday, August 6 in Canton, Ohio, when the Arizona Cardinals and Carolina Panthers play the Pro Football Hall of Fame Game. Most starters will sit — which means the spotlight belongs to rookies. Here's what the combine numbers say about the ones worth watching.</p>
